{#- MeterDataRelease: the member asks the grid operator holding the readings (`dso`) to
    release them to the offer's recipient. Released to the community itself, the
    readings are "released"; to another party, they are "made available" and the text
    says who that party is. The sentence on what depends on the release lists the
    consent offers that require this one, in the offers' order, by their purpose's
    `noun`. -#}
{% import 'consent-texts/1.0/common.j2' as c with context %}
{% import 'macros/text.j2' as text %}

{% macro title(lang, offer, recipient) %}
{{- 'Accesso ai dati di misura del contatore' if lang == 'it' else 'Access to my meter readings' -}}
{% endmacro %}

{#- "La stima dell'incentivo e la sperimentazione sulla flessibilità usano questi dati" -#}
{% macro dependents(lang, offer) %}
{%- set ns = namespace(nouns=[], plural=false) -%}
{%- for use in offers if use.legal_basis == offer.legal_basis and offer.id in (use.get('requires_offers') or []) -%}
{%- import 'consent-texts/1.0/purposes/' ~ use.purpose ~ '.j2' as purpose with context -%}
{%- set ns.nouns = ns.nouns + [purpose.noun(lang)] -%}
{%- set ns.plural = ns.plural or purpose.plural or ns.nouns | length > 1 -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if lang == 'it' -%}
{{ text.cap(text.join(ns.nouns, 'it')) }} {{ 'usano' if ns.plural else 'usa' }} questi dati
{%- else -%}
{{ text.cap(text.join(ns.nouns, 'en')) }} {{ 'use' if ns.plural else 'uses' }} this data
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro body(lang, offer, recipient) %}
{% set to_community = recipient.kind == 'rec' %}
{% set role = c.role(lang, recipient) %}
{% if lang == 'it' %}
{% if to_community %}
Chiedo a {{ dso.short }}, che gestisce il mio contatore, di rilasciare a {{ c.name(recipient) }} le misure del mio punto di prelievo (POD): {{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'full') }}.
{% else %}
Chiedo a {{ dso.short }}, che gestisce il mio contatore, di rendere disponibili a {{ c.name(recipient) }} le misure del mio punto di prelievo (POD): {{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'full') }}.
{% endif %}
Per questo {{ rec.short }} comunica a {{ dso.short }} il codice del POD riferito alla mia adesione.
{% if role %}{{ recipient.short }} {{ role }}. {% endif %}{{ dependents(lang, offer) }}: senza questo consenso i miei dati di misura non vengono {{ 'rilasciati' if to_community else 'resi disponibili' }} a {{ recipient.short }}.
{{ c.optional(lang) }}: {{ c.after_withdrawal(lang, 'release') }}.
{% else %}
{% if to_community %}
I ask {{ dso.short }}, which operates my meter, to release to {{ c.name(recipient) }} the readings of my supply point (POD): {{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'full') }}.
{% else %}
I ask {{ dso.short }}, which operates my meter, to make the readings of my supply point (POD) available to {{ c.name(recipient) }}: {{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'full') }}.
{% endif %}
For this, {{ rec.short }} gives {{ dso.short }} the code of the POD referring to my membership.
{% if role %}{{ recipient.short }} {{ role }}. {% endif %}{{ dependents(lang, offer) }}: without this consent my meter readings are not {{ 'released' if to_community else 'made available' }} to {{ recipient.short }}.
{{ c.optional(lang) }}: {{ c.after_withdrawal(lang, 'release') }}.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
